h-from-cinema-4d-beta-2\">Publish from Cinema 4D (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from houdini (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-houdini\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-houdini-beta-2\">Publish from Houdini (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from solidworks (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-solidworks\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-solidworks-beta-2\">Publish from SolidWorks (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from spline, and figma (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-spline\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-spline-and-figma-beta-2\">Publish from Spline, and Figma (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"camera paths and default walkthroughs\" href=\"/docs/guides/camera-paths\" id=\"lnk-camera-paths-and-default-walkthroughs-2\">Camera paths and default walkthroughs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"hotspots and doors\" href=\"/docs/guides/hotspots-and-doors\" id=\"lnk-hotspots-and-doors-2\">Hotspots and doors</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse capture: film a room (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/film-a-room\" id=\"lnk-verse-capture-film-a-room-beta-2\">Verse Capture: film a room (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse play: host a web game\" href=\"/docs/guides/host-a-web-game\" id=\"lnk-verse-play-host-a-web-game-2\">Verse Play: host a web game</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"spatial bench\" href=\"/docs/guides/spatial-bench\" id=\"lnk-spatial-bench-2\">Spatial Bench</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"light and dark theme\" href=\"/docs/guides/light-and-dark-theme\" id=\"lnk-light-and-dark-theme-2\">Light and dark theme</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"share privately with tokens\" href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately\" id=\"lnk-share-privately-with-tokens-2\">Share privately with tokens</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"show your clients who looked\" href=\"/docs/guides/analytics\" id=\"lnk-show-your-clients-who-looked-2\">Show your clients who looked</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed anywhere: wordpress, shopify, webflow\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-wordpress-shopify-webflow-2\">Embed anywhere: WordPress, Shopify, Webflow</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse for commerce: 3d on product pages (woocommerce, magento, bigcommerce, salesforce)\" href=\"/docs/guides/commerce\" id=\"lnk-verse-for-commerce-3d-on-product-pages-w-2\">Verse for Commerce: 3D on product pages (WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce, Salesforce)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse links and embeds: embed the viewer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-the-viewer\" id=\"lnk-verse-links-and-embeds-embed-the-viewer-2\">Verse links and embeds: embed the viewer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"export a flythrough video\" href=\"/docs/guides/export-video\" id=\"lnk-export-a-flythrough-video-2\">Export a flythrough video</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"collect client review comments\" href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-collect-client-review-comments-2\">Collect client review comments</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"author a guided tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/author-a-guided-tour\" id=\"lnk-author-a-guided-tour-2\">Author a guided tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"video on surfaces, sound in the room\" href=\"/docs/guides/video-and-audio\" id=\"lnk-video-on-surfaces-sound-in-the-room-2\">Video on surfaces, sound in the room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from ifc or usd\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc-or-usd-2\">Publish from IFC or USD</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"upload fbx and obj\" href=\"/docs/guides/upload-fbx-obj\" id=\"lnk-upload-fbx-and-obj-2\">Upload FBX and OBJ</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"build a configurator\" href=\"/docs/guides/build-a-configurator\" id=\"lnk-build-a-configurator-2\">Build a configurator</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"present a scene to a room\" href=\"/docs/guides/present-a-scene\" id=\"lnk-present-a-scene-to-a-room-2\">Present a scene to a room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse-prepare: the local compression step\" href=\"/docs/guides/verse-prepare\" id=\"lnk-verse-prepare-the-local-compression-step-2\">verse-prepare: the local compression step</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"tune quality knobs\" href=\"/docs/guides/tune-quality\" id=\"lnk-tune-quality-knobs-2\">Tune quality knobs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"run your own server\" href=\"/docs/guides/run-your-own-server\" id=\"lnk-run-your-own-server-2\">Run your own server</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"monitor production\" href=\"/docs/guides/monitor-production\" id=\"lnk-monitor-production-2\">Monitor production</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"ask verse, the site assistant\" href=\"/docs/guides/ask-verse\" id=\"lnk-ask-verse-the-site-assistant-2\">Ask Verse, the site assistant</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: floor plan to 3d home\" href=\"/docs/guides/floor-plan-to-3d\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-floor-plan-to-3d-home-2\">Verse Home: floor plan to 3D home</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/instant-home\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-plan-to-a-home-buyers-walk-re-2\">Verse Home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page\" href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-one-tag-any-page-2\">&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"designer tools: framer, webflow, figma\" href=\"/docs/guides/designer-tools\" id=\"lnk-designer-tools-framer-webflow-figma-2\">Designer tools: Framer, Webflow, Figma</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"react and vue wrappers\" href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue-wrappers-2\">React and Vue wrappers</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"rest client round trip\" href=\"/docs/guides/rest-client\" id=\"lnk-rest-client-round-trip-2\">REST client round trip</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with woocommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-woocommerce-2\">Sell with WooCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with bigcommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-bigcommerce-2\">Sell with BigCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with magento / adobe commerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-2\">Sell with Magento / Adobe Commerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in wix\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-wix\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-wix-2\">Embed in Wix</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in squarespace\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-squarespace\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-squarespace-2\">Embed in Squarespace</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in framer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-framer\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-framer-2\">Embed in Framer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in ghost and hubspot\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-2\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with zapier\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-zapier\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-zapier-2\">Automate with Zapier</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with make\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-make\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-make-2\">Automate with Make</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with n8n\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-n8n\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-n8n-2\">Automate with n8n</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-10\"><h2>Blog & updates</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"all posts\" href=\"/docs/blog/index\" id=\"lnk-all-posts-2\">All posts</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"how verse streams a building\" href=\"/docs/blog/how-verse-streams-a-building\" id=\"lnk-how-verse-streams-a-building-2\">How Verse streams a building</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.7: what's new for you\" href=\"/docs/blog/verse-engine-2-7-whats-new\" id=\"lnk-2-7-what-s-new-for-you-2\">2.7: what's new for you</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.0 release notes for humans\" href=\"/docs/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" id=\"lnk-2-0-release-notes-for-humans-2\">2.0 release notes for humans</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-11\"><h2>Integrations</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"integrations: every platform at a glance\" href=\"/docs/integrations\" id=\"lnk-integrations-every-platform-at-a-glance-2\">Integrations: every platform at a glance</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-12\"><h2>API & SDK</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api, sdk and mcp: embed, sdk, webhooks\" href=\"/docs/developers\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-sdk-and-mcp-embed-sdk-webhooks-2\">Verse API, SDK and MCP: embed, SDK, webhooks</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api reference\" href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-reference-2\">Verse API reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api quickstart\" href=\"/docs/api-quickstart\" id=\"lnk-api-quickstart-2\">API quickstart</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api changelog\" href=\"/docs/api-changelog\" id=\"lnk-api-changelog-2\">API changelog</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed sdk reference\" href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-2\">Embed SDK reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse sdk: js / ts (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)\" href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-verse-sdk-js-ts-ctruhtech-verse-sdk-2\">Verse SDK: JS / TS (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse mcp server for ai agents\" href=\"/docs/mcp\" id=\"lnk-verse-mcp-server-for-ai-agents-2\">Verse MCP server for AI agents</a></section><p class=\"docs-no-results\" hidden>No matching guides.</p></div></nav></aside><div class=\"doc-body\"><article class=\"doc-article\" id=\"art-doc-article\"><h1 id=\"publish-from-archicad\">Publish from Archicad<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#publish-from-archicad\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section\">#</a></h1>\n<blockquote><p>**Status: 4.0.0-beta.1 — upload and IFC road tested, needs a real Archicad\ninstall.** <code>verse_publish_archicad.py</code> published a sample IFC4 house to a\nreal local Verse server — converted on the server, <code>status: done</code>, the\nobject index (<code>.props.json</code>) served, the link opening — using the server\nsaved with <code>--save-settings</code>; with no Archicad running, <code>--from-archicad</code>\nsays in one sentence how to fix it (<code>web/test/fix-verify-aec.mjs</code>). Talking\nto a <strong>running Archicad</strong> through its JSON API has not been tested yet.</p></blockquote>\n<p>Archicad has no scriptable exporter and no in-app Python, so the road is:\n<strong>Archicad saves IFC</strong> — its best export; the Verse server reads IFC\nnatively, one object per <code>IfcProduct</code> with storeys and property sets, so a\nclick in the link names the wall (<a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc\">Publish from IFC</a>) —\n<strong>or FBX</strong>, and <code>verse_publish_archicad.py</code> uploads it with progress, prints\nthe share link, copies it and opens it.</p>\n<p><strong>You need:</strong> Archicad <strong>23+</strong> (any version that writes IFC2x3 / IFC4),\nPython <strong>3.8+</strong> on the same machine. For <code>--from-archicad</code>: Archicad <strong>26+</strong>\nwith the <em>JSON Interface for Archicad</em> add-on.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-install\">1. Install<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#1-install\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-2\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Download <strong><code>VersePublish-Archicad-4.0.0-beta.1.zip</code></strong> from the\n<a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" id=\"lnk-downloads-page\">downloads page</a> once the packages\nare published, or build it:</p>\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"sh\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-sh\">sh integrations/aec/archicad/make_package.sh   # -&gt; integrations/aec/archicad/dist/VersePublish-Archicad-4.0.0-beta.1.zip</code></pre></div>\n<p>Unzip anywhere and keep the three Python files together. Stdlib only —\nnothing to <code>pip install</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-server-and-key\">2. Server and key<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#2-server-and-key\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-3\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Save them once:</p>\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"sh\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy-2\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-sh\">python3 verse_publish_archicad.py --save-settings --server https://verse.ctruh.com --api-key &lt;key&gt;</code></pre></div>\n<p>Nothing is compiled in. They are stored in the per-user file every Verse\nplug-in shares — <code>%APPDATA%\\Ctruh\\VersePublish\\settings.json</code> on Windows,\n<code>~/Library/Application Support/Ctruh/VersePublish/settings.json</code> on macOS —\nin its <code>archicad</code> section; values saved as shared from another tool apply\ntoo. Precedence: flags, then <code>VERSE_SERVER</code> / <code>VERSE_API_KEY</code> /\n<code>VERSE_TOKEN</code>, then the file. <code>python3 verse_settings.py archicad</code> shows what\nis in effect (keys masked).</p>\n<h2 id=\"3-export-and-publish\">3. Export and publish<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#3-export-and-publish\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-4\">#</a></h2>\n<ol><li>In Archicad: <strong>File ▸ Save as…</strong>, type <strong>IFC</strong> (or <strong>IFC zip</strong>),\ntranslator <em>General Export</em> (Geometry <em>BREP</em> where available, <em>Export\nproperty sets</em> on). Save it <strong>next to the <code>.pln</code></strong>.</li><li>Run either\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"sh\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy-3\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-sh\">python3 verse_publish_archicad.py model.ifc\npython3 verse_publish_archicad.py --from-archicad   # asks the running Archicad for the project, finds the IFC beside it</code></pre></div></li><li>You see <em>Uploading… 100%</em>, <em>Converting</em>, the build stages, then the\nlink — copied and opened (<code>--no-open</code> to skip). The Verse page opens with\nthe <em>Objects</em> panel listing storeys and element types.</li></ol>\n<p><strong>Success looks like:</strong> the script prints the build stages and the link (copied, and opened unless <code>--no-open</code>); the Verse page opens with the <em>Objects</em> panel listing storeys and element types.</p>\n<p>For one button: a <strong>Publisher</strong> set with an IFC item and a post-publish\nhook that runs the script — Publisher saves IFC without the dialog.</p>\n<p>Files over 100 MB use the resumable upload: a dropped connection continues where the server got to. <code>Ctrl-C</code> cancels with a plain\nsentence saying whether anything was published.</p>\n<h2 id=\"troubleshooting\">Troubleshooting<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#troubleshooting\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-5\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Every problem ends in one sentence; the first words tell you which row applies.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>You see</th><th>What it means</th><th>Do this</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><em>&quot;Could not reach the Verse server at …&quot;</em></td><td>Wrong server URL, no internet, or a firewall / proxy blocking the plug-in.</td><td>Check <strong>Server URL</strong> in <code>--save-settings</code> (or <code>settings.json</code>) (default <code>https://verse.ctruh.com</code>) and open it in a browser.</td></tr><tr><td><em>&quot;The Verse server at … did not recognise the account token …&quot;</em></td><td>The token is mistyped, was revoked, or belongs to another server. Nothing was uploaded.</td><td>Copy the token again from <strong>Studio</strong>, or clear it to publish without an account.</td></tr><tr><td><em>&quot;The server did not accept your API key or account token …&quot;</em></td><td>This server only takes uploads with an API key; the sentence ends with its reason.</td><td>Enter the key from the server&#39;s operator in <code>--save-settings</code> (or <code>settings.json</code>).</td></tr><tr><td><em>&quot;Upload limit reached: …&quot;</em></td><td>The hourly upload limit, or the API key&#39;s daily quota.</td><td>Wait as the sentence says, or add an account token from Studio (a higher limit).</td></tr><tr><td><em>&quot;The server is busy right now. …&quot;</em> / <em>&quot;The server is out of storage. …&quot;</em></td><td>The server&#39;s build queue or disk is full. Your file is fine.</td><td>Publish again in a few minutes.</td></tr><tr><td><em>&quot;The upload kept failing …&quot;</em></td><td>The connection dropped again and again.</td><td>Publish again when the connection is steady; a large upload continues where it stopped.</td></tr><tr><td><em>&quot;Verse cannot build … files yet. Export the model as GLB (or FBX / OBJ) and publish that file instead.&quot;</em></td><td>STEP / IGES / native CAD files are not built by the server yet.</td><td>Export GLB (or FBX / OBJ) and publish that.</td></tr><tr><td><em>&quot;Stopped waiting for the server. The scene is still being built …&quot;</em></td><td>You cancelled after the upload; the server keeps building.</td><td>The scene appears in your Verse dashboard (with an account token) when it is ready.</td></tr><tr><td><em>&quot;Could not reach Archicad&#39;s JSON API on port …&quot;</em></td><td><code>--from-archicad</code> needs Archicad 26+ with the JSON interface add-on.</td><td><strong>Options ▸ Add-On Manager</strong>, enable it; <code>--port</code> if you changed it — or pass the IFC file instead.</td></tr><tr><td><em>&quot;No IFC or FBX export found beside the project …&quot;</em></td><td>The IFC was not saved next to the <code>.pln</code>.</td><td><strong>File ▸ Save as… ▸ IFC</strong> next to the <code>.pln</code>, then run again.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Anything else: send the whole sentence (and, for a build error, the scene name) to hello@ctruh.com.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-has-been-tested\">What has been tested<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#what-has-been-tested\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-6\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>IFC → real server: converted, done, object index served, link opens</td><td>tested</td></tr><tr><td><code>--save-settings</code> → the shared settings file; no Archicad → plain sentence</td><td>tested</td></tr><tr><td>Shared Python helper (GLB / OBJ+units / IFC / FBX, one-shot + resumable, dead server, cancel)</td><td>tested</td></tr><tr><td><code>--from-archicad</code> against a running Archicad (<code>IsAlive</code>, <code>GetProjectInfo</code> field names)</td><td><strong>needs a real install</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"next\">Next<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#next\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-7\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc-2\">Publish from IFC</a> — what the object index gives you</li><li><a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-sketchup\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-sketchup\">Publish from SketchUp</a> · <a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-revit\" id=\"lnk-revit\">Revit</a> · <a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-rhino\" id=\"lnk-rhino\">Rhino</a> · <a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-3dsmax\" id=\"lnk-3ds-max\">3ds Max</a></li></ul></article><div class=\"doc-source\">Published documentation from <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/docs/#/guides/publish-from-archicad\" id=\"lnk-verse-by-ctruh\">Verse by Ctruh</a></div></div><aside class=\"docs-toc\" id=\"asd-docs-toc\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#1-install\" id=\"lnk-1-install\">1. Install</a><a href=\"#2-server-and-key\" id=\"lnk-2-server-and-key\">2. Server and key</a><a href=\"#3-export-and-publish\" id=\"lnk-3-export-and-publish\">3. Export and publish</a><a href=\"#troubleshooting\" id=\"lnk-troubleshooting\">Troubleshooting</a><a href=\"#what-has-been-tested\" id=\"lnk-what-has-been-tested\">What has been tested</a><a href=\"#next\" id=\"lnk-next\">Next</a></aside></section>"}